      "sectionStartLine": 7820,
      "sectionEndLine": 7827,
      "startColumn": 1,
      "text": "## set_temp_variable\n\n* Supported Scopes: any\n* Supported Targets: none\n\nSets a temp variable to a value, another variable, or a [math expression](script_math_expression.md).\n`tooltip` can be used to override tooltip title with LEFT and RIGHT tokens.\n",
      "nextLine": null,
      "nextColumn": null
    }
  },
